            "text_rf79Xq": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>At rebirth, a man no longer looks for what is loud or trending. He looks for what reflects who he has become. His choices become deliberate — class over flash, quiet luxury over shine, responsibility over ego. He carries himself with discipline, respects craft and community, and understands the importance of showing up the right way. What surrounds him — the way he lives, moves, and presents himself — reflects restraint, confidence, and earned authority. Nothing is chosen to impress. Everything is chosen to endure. Every Ash Theory product is a reflection of the reborn man — calm, composed, and certain of who he is.<br/></p>",
